  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 171599663104
    m_Localized: ROOM 9-B
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1948902428672
    m_Localized: press lmb to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2056914145280
    m_Localized: PROTOCOL OF THE INTERROGATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2243627782144
    m_Localized: You do not mention the test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2325089554432
    m_Localized: You do not explain the questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2379053469696
    m_Localized: "They sit. They answer. They don\u2019t know what it's for.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2520212770816
    m_Localized: "They think it\u2019s routine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2566077485056
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s not."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2646692007936
    m_Localized: Inside every answer - a signal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2795438804992
    m_Localized: Inside every blink - a lie, or the lack of one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3298734313472
    m_Localized: The machine knows. I just confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3376421212160
    m_Localized: They smile. They sweat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3487524130816
    m_Localized: Some cry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3551021699072
    m_Localized: "Some don\u2019t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3611461619712
    m_Localized: "One of them isn\u2019t what they claim to be."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3678662758400
    m_Localized: "And tonight, they\u2019ll find out too late."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3773009432576
    m_Localized: I ask the questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3820505731072
    m_Localized: The machine watches the eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3901904588800
    m_Localized: If she sees a glitch...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4157081849856
    m_Localized: "they\u2019re not human."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6797811453952
    m_Localized: "LMB - Inspect  \nRMB - Use\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022449987584
    m_Localized: mouse speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7201265750016
    m_Localized: master volume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7277073600512
    m_Localized: ESC to close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9254050402304
    m_Localized: Russian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9339849084928
    m_Localized: English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9404038713344
    m_Localized: Select a language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17257025703936
    m_Localized: english
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18148151726080
    m_Localized: replicant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18165465812992
    m_Localized: human
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18639426359296
    m_Localized: "<b>[POLICE OPERATIONS MANUAL \u2014 FILE #77-\u0394-42]\n\nINTERACTIVE
      CONTROL BRIEF \u2014 YEAR 2064\n\nDEPARTMENT OF BEHAVIORAL ANALYSIS & MEMORY
      RETRIEVAL</b>\n\n<b><size=150%>SECTION I: GENERAL DIRECTIVE</size></b>\n<size=135%>This
      manual is issued to Interface Operations personnel under the Ministry of Identity
      Recognition and Behavioral Control. Prior to deployment, agents must review
      all authorized tactical interactions within the simulated environment. Protocol
      violations may result in field desynchronization or loss of subjective stability."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18651027804160
    m_Localized: "\n<b><size=150%>FIELD AGENT CONTROL SCHEMA</b></size>\n<size=150%><b>Z
      \u2014 ZOOM</b></size>\nInspect objects up close. Enhanced visual analysis
      protocol.\n\n<size=150%><b>LMB \u2014 INTERACT / SKIP / FIRE</b></size>\nExamine
      objects, skip dialogue printing, or fire weapon (if authorized).\n\n<size=150%><b>RMB
      \u2014 USE / FLIP PAGE</b></size>\nContextual actions. Flip documents or engage
      with devices.\n\n<size=150%><b>Q \u2014 PLACE ITEM</b></size>\nReturn held
      item to original position.\n\n<size=150%><b>WASD \u2014 MOVE</b></size>\nNavigate
      environment. Standard agent locomotion input."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18661794582528
    m_Localized: "\n<b><size=150%>SECTION II: SUBJECT VERIFICATION PROTOCOL</size></b>\r\n\r\nProcedure
      is simple: initiate verbal interaction using calibrated emotional stimuli.\r\n\r\nMonitor
      the following biometric indicators in real-time:\r\n\u2022 <b>Response Delay</b>
      \u2014 excessive pause may indicate synthetic cognitive processing.\r\n\u2022
      <b>Pulse Variability</b> \u2014 erratic shifts can imply poor emotional mimicry
      or high stress adaptation.\r\n\u2022 <b>Pupil Reaction</b> \u2014 unnatural
      dilation or lack of response is a high-risk marker.\r\n\r\nLog all anomalies. 
      \r\nFlag subjects displaying consistent incongruity between verbal content
      and biometric feedback.  \r\nNote: Replicants may mimic logic, but struggle
      with chaotic emotional nuance. Use this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29876650446848
    m_Localized: PRESS ANY KEY TO CONTINUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30504856522752
    m_Localized: username
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30582690222080
    m_Localized: Enter text...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31764011749376
    m_Localized: password
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31889933144064
    m_Localized: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29993403092992
    m_Localized: reg/auth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36057993383936
    m_Localized: retry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
